/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人；人类；人们；人品；品格；性格</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103566\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>としてよくできた<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He is a man of character.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">認識</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にんしき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">认识；意识；理解；知识；认知</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85557\"><ruby>美<rp>(</rp><rt>び</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>認識<rp>(</rp><rt>にんしき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>倫理<rp>(</rp><rt>りんり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>検査<rp>(</rp><rt>けんさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となり<ruby>得<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The perception of beauty is a moral test.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妊娠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にんしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">妊娠；怀孕；受孕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"87310\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>妊娠<rp>(</rp><rt>にんしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>幸<rp>(</rp><rt>しあわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She is happy to have conceived a baby by him.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人情</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にんじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人性；共情；善良；同情；人之常情；常识；风俗习惯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77752\"><ruby>隣近所<rp>(</rp><rt>となりきんじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>見栄<rp>(</rp><rt>みえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>張<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るのは<ruby>人情<rp>(</rp><rt>にんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It&#x27;s only natural to keep up with the Joneses.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">任務</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にんむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">职责；职能；职务；使命；任务；角色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137533\"><ruby>大使<rp>(</rp><rt>たいし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>任務<rp>(</rp><rt>にんむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>責任<rp>(</rp><rt>せきにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The ambassador is responsible for the assignment.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">任命</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にんめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">任命；提名；委派；委任；指定</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"98014\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>