ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170547\"><ruby>最後<rp>(</rp><rt>さいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>戦<rp>(</rp><rt>たたか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Let&#x27;s fight to the last.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">脱掉；脱下；脱去</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224569\">ここで<ruby>靴<rp>(</rp><rt>くつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>脱<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がなければなりませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Do I have to take off my shoes here?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜け出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬけだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">溜出；偷偷溜走；突破脱困；冲到前面；取得领先；领先；（如头发）开始脱落；跳出循环；从循环中退出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75217\">あ、みんなには<ruby>内緒<rp>(</rp><rt>ないしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だよ？<ruby>寮<rp>(</rp><rt>りょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>夜中<rp>(</rp><rt>よなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すのは<ruby>厳罰<rp>(</rp><rt>げんばつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だからね？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Oh, that&#x27;s a secret, OK? Because slipping out of the dorm in the night is severely punished.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抜ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">脱落；掉落；遗漏；缺失；逃脱；松开；褪色；变色；磨破；穿破（如衣服）；离开；退出（如会议）；清澈；透明（如天空）；心不在焉；粗心；不专心；愚蠢；退出循环（程序）；穿过；通过；垮掉；倒塌；得分超过88分而获胜（不含得分组合的积分）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231162\">あの<ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>抜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けなくて。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I can&#x27;t get that song out of my head.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盗み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬすみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">盗窃；偷窃；盗取</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209042\">その<ruby>少年<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みをしかねない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The boy is capable of robbery.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盗む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬすむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">偷；盗取；抄袭；窃取（技巧、想法等）；暗中学习；偷偷地做；悄悄地进行；在匆忙中抽时间做；利用片刻时间做；盗垒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124148\"><ruby>盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれたお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があきらめられない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I won&#x27;t give up on the stolen money.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">布</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">布料；织物；纺织品；布币（中国古代铲形铜币）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220078\">この<ruby>布<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>値段<rp>(</rp><rt>ねだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>品質<rp>(</rp><rt>ひんしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This cloth is good in quality for its price.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沼</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沼泽；湿地；泥沼；池塘；痴迷；沉溺；上瘾；丑男；相貌丑陋的男人；智障；精神残疾人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209007\">その<ruby>沼<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはサギがたくさん<ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Lots of herons live in the marsh.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">濡らす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬらす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">弄湿；润湿；打湿；浸湿；蘸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112074\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はタオルを<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>濡<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He wetted his towel with water.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塗る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">涂；涂抹；敷；上漆；刷；贴（壁纸）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215528\">ジョンがドアにペンキを<ruby>塗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">John has been painting the door.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">温い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぬるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">温热的；不冷不热的；微温的；宽松的；宽容的；不严厉的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223801\">このコーヒーはぬるいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This coffee is not hot enough.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぬれる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被浸湿；受潮；沾湿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80133\"><ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のおかげで<ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にぬれずにすんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The trees kept me out of the rain.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ね</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">价格；价钱；成本；价值；价值；优点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113046\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にたいへん<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>値<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He put the painting at a very high price.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">根</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">植物的根；（牙齿、毛发等的）根；（粉刺等的）核；（万恶等的）根源；源头；起因；基础；本性；真性情；（钓鱼用语）暗礁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"107019\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>根<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はやさしい<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He was a good fellow at heart.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">音</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">声音；音色；音调；声响；鸣叫声</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">音色</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねいろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">音色；音质；音品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223869\">このギターは<ruby>音色<rp>(</rp><rt>ねいろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The guitar is in tune.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">値打ち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねうち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">价值；值得；优点；估价；评估；评价；便宜货；划算；物有所值</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221388\">この<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>修理<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するだけの<ruby>値打<rp>(</rp><rt>ねう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちはない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It isn&#x27;t worth repairing this car.</span></div></li>"]